### Unity generated folders
[Ll]ibrary/
[Tt]emp/
[Oo]bj/
[Bb]uild/
[Bb]uilds/
[Ll]ogs/
[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
[Mm]emory[Cc]aptures/
[Rr]ecordings/

# Force-commit the package project's tracked folders.
!/src/NotchSolution/Assets/**
!/src/NotchSolution/Packages/**
!/src/NotchSolution/ProjectSettings/**

# Ignore .meta only when its asset is also ignored.
!**/[Aa]ssets/**/*.meta

# Keep UPM `~` folders (Samples~, Documentation~).
!Samples~/
!**/Samples~/
!Documentation~/
!**/Documentation~/

